-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. THE ONLY PERMITTED USES
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Because this repository is public on GitHub, GitHub's Terms of Service let you
view it and fork it within GitHub. Beyond that, you may do only the following:

  a. read the Software on GitHub;
  b. fork this repository, clone this repository or your fork, modify your
     copy, and run it on your own computer (including letting it load files
     from static.quranwbw.com the way the app normally does), solely to make
     a contribution to this repository;
  c. submit issues and pull requests to this repository;
  d. visit and use the QuranWBW.com website in the ordinary way, to read,
     listen to, and study the Qur'an for yourself.

That's it. A fork or clone may not be deployed, hosted, published as a website
or app, or used for any purpose other than making a contribution to this
repository.

