4. DATA AND CONTENT HAVE THEIR OWN, SEPARATE LICENSING
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The data and content shown on QuranWBW.com are NOT part of the Software and are
NOT covered by this file in any way that grants you rights. They are governed
separately, and they come from different owners with different terms.

"Data and Content" includes, without limitation: Qur'anic text editions and
their encodings, word-by-word translations, word-by-word transliterations,
verse translations, tafsir, morphology and grammar data, roots and lemmas,
word and verse audio, audio timing and segmentation data, Mushaf page and
line layouts, fonts and glyph maps, Tajweed data, topics, duas and
supplications, indexes, metadata, images, and every JSON or other file served
from static.quranwbw.com or any other QuranWBW domain.

4.1  QuranWBW's own data. A large part of the Data and Content was created,
     translated, recorded, corrected, compiled, aligned, structured, or
     designed by QuranWBW. This includes its word-by-word data, its word audio
     and timing data, its compiled datasets, its modified fonts, and the
     selection and arrangement of all of the above. All of it is proprietary to
     QuranWBW. All rights are reserved. No permission is given to copy, use,
     or redistribute any of it.

4.2  Third-party data. Other parts of the Data and Content belong to their
     original authors, translators, reciters, publishers, and institutions,
     and are used under each owner's own license or permission. Those terms
     differ from source to source, and many do not allow redistribution. This
     file grants you nothing in respect of third-party data. If you want to use
     it, you must get it from the original source and follow that source's
     terms. QuranWBW's permission to use it does not pass to you.

4.3  The Qur'an. Nothing in this file claims ownership of the Qur'an itself.
     The rights reserved here apply to QuranWBW's specific digital editions,
     data, translations, recordings, and their selection and arrangement, and
     to the rights of the third parties described in 4.2.

4.4  Prohibited, for all Data and Content obtained from QuranWBW.com,
     static.quranwbw.com, this repository, or any other QuranWBW service,
     without prior written permission from the QuranWBW team:

       a. scraping, crawling, downloading in bulk, mirroring, or extracting
          data from QuranWBW.com, static.quranwbw.com, or any QuranWBW
          service, whether by hand or by automated means;
       b. hotlinking to, or loading files from, static.quranwbw.com or any
          QuranWBW domain from another website, app, or service;
       c. rehosting, repackaging, or redistributing any of it, in any form;
       d. building datasets, APIs, libraries, apps, or websites from it;
       e. using it to train, fine-tune, or evaluate any machine learning or
          artificial intelligence system;
       f. using it in anything that shows advertising, charges money, asks for
          forced donations, locks features, or requires an account;
       g. presenting it as your own.

     Giving credit does not make any of the above allowed. You must get prior
     written permission from the QuranWBW team first. Where permission is
     given, you must also give clear credit to QuranWBW.com and to the
     original owners.

     This section does not cover:

       - running a local copy of the app as section 2(b) allows, which may
         load files from static.quranwbw.com the way the app normally does;
       - third-party data you obtain on your own from its original source,
         which is governed only by that source's terms (see 4.2).

